{"id":420,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"Once the fruit growing alongside the main body is large and plump, Cherubi will use the nutrients within to evolve. The fruit then detaches, becoming nourishment for other creatures."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The deeper a Cherubi’s red, the more nutrients it has stockpiled in its body. And the sweeter and tastier its small ball!"},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It nimbly dashes about to avoid getting pecked by bird Pokémon that would love to make off with its small, nutrient-rich storage ball."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It evolves by sucking the energy out of the small ball where it had been storing nutrients."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Pearl"],"text":"Sunlight colors it red. When the small ball is drained of nutrients, it shrivels to herald evolution."},{"games":["White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"The small ball is not only filled with nutrients, it is also tasty. Starly try to peck it off."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"The small ball holds the nutrients needed for evolution. Apparently, it is very sweet and tasty."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."}],"eggGroups":["Fairy","Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":null,"color":"Pink","shape":"Heads","evolution":{"id":420,"name":"Cherubi","condition":null,"children":[{"id":421,"name":"Cherrim","condition":"Lv. 25","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,33],[1,234],[5,670],[10,74],[15,270],[20,345],[26,73],[30,36],[35,572],[40,388],[45,76]],"machine":[213,331,605,577,203,412,263,202,447,580,270,345,676,182,156,496,219,402,214,173,76,164,241,14,311],"egg":[312,111,579,505,361,267,75,205,230,321],"tutor":[803]},"cards":[{"id":"me55-6","name":"Cherubi","set":"30th Celebration","date":"2026-09-16","rarity":"Common","number":"6","artist":"Kurata S